00:00:07.092 --> 00:00:08.860
WHEN THE FOUNDERS OF THIS

00:00:08.861 --> 00:00:10.728
COUNTRY DESIGNED THE AMERICAN

00:00:10.729 --> 00:00:11.663
REPUBLIC SOMETHING WE'RE

00:00:11.664 --> 00:00:13.231
GRATEFUL FOR, BUT NOT EVERYONE

00:00:13.232 --> 00:00:15.334
