00:00:42.061 --> 00:00:42.994
PEOPLE INEVITABLY WOULD BECOME

00:00:42.995 --> 00:00:43.462
TIRE KNEE.

00:00:43.596 --> 00:00:45.130
THAT'S WHAT THEY SAID AT THE

00:00:45.131 --> 00:00:45.498
TIME.

00:00:45.631 --> 00:00:46.265
IT HASN'T HAPPENED.

00:00:46.398 --> 00:00:47.932
FOR MORE THAN TWO CENTURIES

00:00:47.933 --> 00:00:50.735
THIS COUNTRY RELIED ON OUR

00:00:50.736 --> 00:00:51.436
INSTITUTIONS BRILLIANTLY

00:00:51.437 --> 00:00:52.604
DESIGNED AND DURABLE

00:00:52.605 --> 00:00:54.205
INSTITUTIONS TO SURVIVE AS AN

00:00:54.206 --> 00:00:56.875
INTACT DEMOCRACY AND WE HAVE

00:00:56.876 --> 00:00:59.210
THROUGH A CIVIL WAR, TWO WORLD

00:00:59.211 --> 00:00:59.911
