ALL OF THOSE EVENTS PUT GREAT

00:01:03.849 --> 00:01:05.951
STRESS ON OUR SYSTEM.

00:01:06.085 --> 00:01:07.119
NONE BROKE IT.

00:01:07.253 --> 00:01:08.287
THEN CAME 2016.

